#: templates/school/privacy.html:4
msgid "How we handle the information you share with Wisdom School."
msgstr ""
"Wisdom School bilan ulashgan ma’lumotlaringizga qanday munosabatda bo‘lamiz."

#: templates/school/privacy.html:8
msgid "What we collect"
msgstr "Biz nimalarni yig‘amiz"

#: templates/school/privacy.html:9
msgid ""
"When you send an enquiry or a message, we receive the details you enter in "
"the form: your name, contact details and your message."
msgstr ""
"Ariza yoki xabar yuborganingizda, shaklga kiritgan ma’lumotlaringizni "
"olamiz: ismingiz, aloqa ma’lumotlari va xabaringiz."

#: templates/school/privacy.html:10
msgid "How we use it"
msgstr "Ulardan qanday foydalanamiz"

#: templates/school/privacy.html:11
msgid ""
"We use this information only to respond to your enquiry and to help your "
"family with admissions. We do not sell or share it with third parties."
msgstr ""
"Bu ma’lumotlardan faqat murojaatingizga javob berish va oilangizga qabul "
"bo‘yicha yordam berish uchun foydalanamiz. Ularni sotmaymiz va uchinchi "
"shaxslarga bermaymiz."

#: templates/school/privacy.html:12
msgid "Your choices"
msgstr "Sizning huquqlaringiz"

#: templates/school/privacy.html:13
msgid ""
"You can ask us to correct or delete your information at any time by "
"contacting the school."
msgstr ""
"Istalgan vaqtda maktab bilan bog‘lanib, ma’lumotlaringizni tuzatish yoki "
"o‘chirishni so‘rashingiz mumkin."

#: templates/school/privacy.html:14
msgid "Accessibility"
msgstr "Foydalanish qulayligi"

#: templates/school/privacy.html:15
msgid ""
"We want everyone to be able to use this website. The site works on phones, "
"tablets and computers, supports keyboard navigation and screen readers. If "
"something is difficult to use, please let us know."
msgstr ""
"Biz saytdan hamma foydalana olishini istaymiz. Sayt telefon, planshet va "
"kompyuterlarda ishlaydi, klaviatura va ekran o‘quvchi dasturlarni qo‘llab-"
"quvvatlaydi. Biror narsa noqulay bo‘lsa, bizga xabar bering."
